`class UpperMeta(type):
    def __new__(cls, name, bases, dct):
        uppercase_dct = {}
        for k, v in dct.items():
            if not k.startswith('__'):
                uppercase_dct[k.upper()] = v
            else:
                uppercase_dct[k] = v
        return super().__new__(cls, name, bases, uppercase_dct)`

